 📖 ABOUT THIS PROJECT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The WinTwin.FXcore library is developed entirely in PowerShell and constitutes
a key component of the WinTwin Fusion Framework. The library provides a wide
range of functions for performing various DISM and USTM operations,
downloading new Windows images, and creating new Windows 11 installation Media
(to name just a few examples).

In short: WinTwin.FXcore is the absolute core library powering the
WinTwin Fusion Framework. If a function isn't defined here,
the framework doesn't need it 😜

